EasyPhoto is a free app for restoring and colorizing pixelated, blurred or damaged photos, Turn your old, blurry photos into gorgeous, clear HD in just ONE TAP. 

Over 100 million photos already revitalized. EasyPhoto is one of the most popular and beloved photo-enhancement apps in the world

In addition, EasyPhoto is also an AI-powered 【ID photo generator】 and 【Photo Scanner】.with 【ID photo generator】,you can change the photo background in just ONE TAP, and convert your ordinary photos into beautiful ID photos! with【Photo Scanner】,you can scan your photo albums and shoeboxes full of photos in no time to backup or share your valuable memories with friends and family.

With EasyPhoto, you can awake and bring back the treasures in your memory, and make your memories no longer blurred! 

Download and enjoy the convenience of cutting-edge AI technology for your life!


--Function Introduction-- 

[Blurred Photos Restoration]
• Turn facial photo into high-definition;
• Enhance everyday portraits and selfies to stunning, influencer-style output;
• Repair old/blurry/scratched photo;
• Make share-worthy viral content with before/after comparisons;

[ Portrait for background ]
• replace the background in ordinary photos and generate new ID photos;
• A variety of ID photo backgrounds are available, or you can choose a custom background from the album;

[ Photo Scan In Seconds]
• Scan an entire photo album in minutes.;
• The photo scanner auto-detects picture boundaries, auto-rotates sideways pics, crops, restores and saves them into a digital album;

[Photo Entertainment]
• Photo Dynamic (Moving the photo), Gender Conversion, Child Face Effect, Ageing Face Effect;
* All done by state of the art AI technology;
* More stunning features on the way!


